.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-API 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-api
.Nd make a raw call to the admin service API
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad api
.Ar PATH
.Op Ar JSON_BODY
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad api
is a low-level escape hatch for calling the admin service's HTTP API
directly.
It sends a request to
.Ar PATH
and pretty-prints the JSON response.
.Pp
With no
.Ar JSON_BODY
the request is a
.Sy GET .
When
.Ar JSON_BODY
is supplied, the request becomes a
.Sy POST
carrying that body.
Use this for endpoints the dedicated subcommands do not cover.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad api /api/system/services
GET the services endpoint and print the response.
.It Ic nomad api /api/zim/wikipedia/select '{"optionId":"all-nopic"}'
POST a JSON body to select a Wikipedia variant.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-downloads 1 ,
.Xr nomad-services 1
